// rule: PROV-4
// expect: accept
// v22 R3. One relation is a union of places. Naming x admits a value within
// x, including its loan on a, while fresh blocks go to b. The v22 pin for an
// escaping arena is PROV-4-union-arena-outside-result-bad.
fn read(a: Arena, b: Arena, x: Bytes in a) -> Bytes in {b, x} {
  x
}
